<p>NOTE - AvtoVAZ includes Lada, Niva and Samara brands.</p>
<p>Fiat's other brands include Autobianchi, Ferrari, Innocenti and</p>
<p>Maserati. FSL includes Lublin and Zuk brands. FSO includes</p>
<p>Polonez brand. Fuji includes Subaru brand. GM's other brands</p>
<p>include Cadillac, Chevrolet and Pontiac. Moskvich (formerly</p>
<p>AZLK) includes Aleko brand. Perusahaan includes Proton brand.</p>
<p>Data reflect retail sales which Reuters calculated from</p>
<p>provisional information provided by various sources, including</p>
<p>automakers and their importers as well as government statistics</p>
<p>bureaus and vehicle industry associations.</p>
<p>Totals for 1996 include revisions from previous surveys.</p>
